  "id": 203982635640333,
  "uuid": "d6fbc552-3172-428c-ac36-f3833c1004d8",
  "is_folder": false,
  "content": {
    "_uid": "64b0a0b2-2bae-9f6e-1cbc-eebfde9e3703",
    "body": [
      {
        "_uid": "0c6b6a05-3222-1898-389d-7e243d64bf78",
        "content": {
          "type": "doc",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "The partnership aims to build on IED's mission to train science and mathematics teachers and arm them with cutting-edge scientific knowledge to inspire young learners to take up STEM careers. It will also provide valuable field experience opportunities for IED's current master's level students. ",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "In addition to joint engagement in consultations and research on science and mathematics teaching, IED and STEMx will also jointly host a biennial conference on teaching and educational issues. ",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "\"This partnership is an excellent opportunity that brings together IED's rich experience in the field of education, academic rigor, deep engagement and robust network of teachers; and STEMx's high-end, cutting-edge, student-centric approach to 21st century learning and career skills, as well as its national and global network to improve learning outcomes using STEM pedagogy,\" said Dr Tasneem Anwar, Assistant Professor & IED's lead for the programme, at the signing ceremony held earlier today.",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "type": "hard_break"
                },
                {
                  "type": "hard_break"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
