    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Aga Khan University through its Institute of Educational Development (IED) has signed on to partner with INNOVentures Global (Pvt) Ltd's 'STEMx - STEM School for the World', to further the quality of science and mathematics teaching and learning through joint programmes and collaborations, over a period of three years.",
